use firn/tags

type Responsibility, Capability, Software, Domain, Criticality, Lifecycle

boot is a Domain
environment is a Domain
long-lived-system-service is a Lifecycle

static {host: Host} has responsibility {responsibility: Responsibility}
static {responsibility: Responsibility} depends on {dependency: Responsibility}
static {responsibility: Responsibility} requires capability {capability: Capability}
static {software: Software} provides capability {capability: Capability}
static {responsibility: Responsibility} requires software {software: Software}
static {software: Software} is realized by {module: Module}
static {responsibility: Responsibility} is realized in {domain: Domain}
  at most one domain per responsibility
static {responsibility: Responsibility} has criticality {criticality: Criticality}
  at most one criticality per responsibility
static {responsibility: Responsibility} has lifecycle {lifecycle: Lifecycle}
  at most one lifecycle per responsibility
derived {host: Host} is responsible for {responsibility: Responsibility}
derived {host: Host} must realize {software: Software} for {responsibility: Responsibility}
derived {host: Host} must realize {software: Software}
derived {software: Software} has a realizing module
derived {host: Host} enables {module: Module} for environment software {software: Software}
derived {responsibility: Responsibility} reaches {dependency: Responsibility}
derived {host: Host} has boot responsibility {responsibility: Responsibility} reaching environment responsibility {dependency: Responsibility}
derived {host: Host} must realize incomplete software {software: Software} for {responsibility: Responsibility}
derived {host: Host} needs capability {capability: Capability} for {responsibility: Responsibility}
derived {responsibility: Responsibility} gets capability {capability: Capability}
derived {host: Host} must start {software: Software} at boot for {responsibility: Responsibility}
derived {host: Host} starts {software: Software} as a long-lived system service for {responsibility: Responsibility}

rule stated-responsibility: ?host is responsible for ?responsibility
  when ?host has responsibility ?responsibility

rule dependent-responsibility: ?host is responsible for ?dependency
  when ?host is responsible for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility depends on ?dependency

rule realization-obligation-for: ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility
  when ?host is responsible for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility requires software ?software

rule realization-obligation: ?host must realize ?software
  when ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility

rule realized: ?software has a realizing module
  when ?software is realized by ?module

rule environment-module-enabled: ?host enables ?module for environment software ?software
  when ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility is realized in environment
  and ?software is realized by ?module
  and ?module is enabled on ?host

rule direct-dependency: ?responsibility reaches ?dependency
  when ?responsibility depends on ?dependency

rule transitive-dependency: ?responsibility reaches ?dependency
  when ?responsibility reaches ?middle
  and ?middle depends on ?dependency

rule boot-reaches-environment: ?host has boot responsibility ?responsibility reaching environment responsibility ?dependency
  when ?host is responsible for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility is realized in boot
  and ?responsibility reaches ?dependency
  and ?dependency is realized in environment

rule incomplete-without-module: ?host must realize incomplete software ?software for ?responsibility
  when ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility
  and not ?software is realized by ?_

rule incomplete-without-domain: ?host must realize incomplete software ?software for ?responsibility
  when ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility
  and not ?responsibility is realized in ?_

rule incomplete-without-criticality: ?host must realize incomplete software ?software for ?responsibility
  when ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility
  and not ?responsibility has criticality ?_

rule incomplete-boot-without-lifecycle: ?host must realize incomplete software ?software for ?responsibility
  when ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility is realized in boot
  and not ?responsibility has lifecycle ?_

rule capability-need: ?host needs capability ?capability for ?responsibility
  when ?host is responsible for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility requires capability ?capability

rule capability-provided: ?responsibility gets capability ?capability
  when ?responsibility requires software ?software
  and ?software provides capability ?capability

rule boot-obligation: ?host must start ?software at boot for ?responsibility
  when ?host must realize ?software for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility is realized in boot

rule boot-admissible: ?host starts ?software as a long-lived system service for ?responsibility
  when ?host must start ?software at boot for ?responsibility
  and ?responsibility has lifecycle long-lived-system-service
  and ?software is realized by ?module
  and ?module is enabled on ?host

requirements for responsibilities
  every ?host, ?software where ?host must realize ?software: ?software has a realizing module
  no ?host, ?software, ?module: ?host enables ?module for environment software ?software
  no ?host, ?responsibility, ?dependency: ?host has boot responsibility ?responsibility reaching environment responsibility ?dependency
  no ?host, ?software, ?responsibility: ?host must realize incomplete software ?software for ?responsibility
  every ?host, ?capability, ?responsibility where ?host needs capability ?capability for ?responsibility: ?responsibility gets capability ?capability
  every ?host, ?software, ?responsibility where ?host must start ?software at boot for ?responsibility: ?host starts ?software as a long-lived system service for ?responsibility
